Cell["\<\
Notation for reciprocal basis element  (intended for elements with down \
indices only)\
\>", "Text",
 FontColor->RGBColor[
  1, 0, 1],ExpressionUUID->"3ce7ddb6-767a-44d2-a2a9-55d18743dda1"],

Cell["\<\
We intentionally use \[Dagger] symbol in order to distinguish the reciprocal \
element from inverse element. In order to compute reciprocal vectors we have \
to provide (in general) full vector basis, whereas inverse of vector can be \
computed from single vector.  \
\>", "Text",
 CellGroupingRules->{
  GroupTogetherGrouping, 
   10001.},ExpressionUUID->"a61a720b-39f5-4a17-8764-2213fe483fcc"],

