  "f7ea8d44-cb3a-4f9a-8982-a6bb0f88c04c"],
 "\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]. It is possible to calculate expansion of outer \
products of vectors (ONLY) using determinants, i.e. without expanding sum of \
