Cell["\<\
toCliffordMatrix[expr, {4,-4}] implements  isomorphism transformation form \
Cl(p,q) to Cl(p+4,q-4).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"b1acac55-7cbb-4fe3-997f-2e4ddc5c2967"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"{", 
