  "In[1553]:=",ExpressionUUID->"fc83f51e-1ebf-457a-bf4a-90e0a3e9ba76"]
}, Closed]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[TextData[{
 
 CounterBox["Section"],
 ".",
 
 CounterBox["Subsection"],
 ".",
 
 CounterBox["Subsubsection"],
 ". Derivative with respect to multivector/vector and \
gaToDirectionalDerivative[ ]."
}], "Subsubsection",ExpressionUUID->"ef6dc708-c10c-407b-9d9f-daf6d73632da"],

Cell["\<\
Vector derivative (gaMultivectorDerivative[_,_?gaVectorQ], \
gaExternalDerivative [ ] and most general \
gaMultivectorDerivative[_,_?gaMultivectorQ] with respect to any basis \
elements is based on gaDirectionalDerivative[ ]. The peculiarity is that here \
we have explicitly indicate which of arguments is differentiated in the case \
if the argument is geometric, outer or inner product. Therefore we have \
multiple definitions. First, make vector derivative a particular case of \
multivector derivative, i.e. vector derivative is the same as multivector \
derivative with respect to reciprocal vector basis elements. For convenience \
instead of providing reciprocal vector basis one can use name of coordinate \
system.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"54f94747-9047-4dee-9dff-92b44a95e2b7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Since gaMultivectorDerivative can act on different side of expression, say ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         OverscriptBox[
          StyleBox["a", "TI"], "."], 
         OverscriptBox["\[Del]", "."]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "\\dot{a}\\dot{\\nabla}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "06cb7ae9-37f0-4fd5-a948-0637d3f04e7b"],
 ", we have to introduce help function gaDerivativeArgument[id_][expr_] , \
which pairs gaMultivectorDerivative noncommutative part with the \
differentiation operator.  Though arguments of gaDerivativeArgument[] can \
commute,  we made gaDerivativeArgument[] noncommutative in order to reduce a \
number of replacement rules. First, introduce syntax, which is more \
convenient to use in most cases. Note, that this input is immediately \
rewrites into standard one, where the operator (which contains non-commuting \
elements) and argument on which acts the differential operator is separated. \
This is necessary step if we want to include action of differential operator \
on the argument which stand on the left hand side of operator. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"f05fe1b7-59a5-4f64-8477-760ed8769206"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "To avoid ambiguity how to understand grouping of multivector derivative we \
will follow definitions of arXiv 1911.07145, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Schindler_2018.pdf\"\>", "Author",
    StripOnInput->False,
    FontColor->RGBColor[0, 0, 1]],
   Appearance->"Frameless",
   ButtonFunction:>SystemOpen[
     FileNameJoin[{
       NotebookDirectory[
        EvaluationNotebook[]], "ElectronicHandBook", "BibliographySources", 
       "Articles", "Schindler_2018_1911.07145.pdf"}]],
   Evaluator->Automatic,
   Method->"Preemptive"]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->
  "47c3ad1d-2939-405c-a992-7ab99d10ea5b"],
 ",",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Schindler_2020.pdf\"\>", "Author",
    StripOnInput->False,
    FontColor->RGBColor[0, 0, 1]],
   Appearance->"Frameless",
   ButtonFunction:>SystemOpen[
     FileNameJoin[{
       NotebookDirectory[
        EvaluationNotebook[]], "ElectronicHandBook", "BibliographySources", 
       "Articles", "Schindler_2020_1911.07145v5.pdf"}]],
   Evaluator->Automatic,
   Method->"Preemptive"]], "Output",ExpressionUUID->
  "47c714b3-6db8-4463-a0d4-763d2a8f73e0"],
 ") , where this derivative is named (see section 9 of the preprint) as \
gradient or vector operator (closely related to divergence + curl). Here are \
the definitions/conventions (on the RHS ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   RowBox[{
    TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
        SubscriptBox[
         StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
         StyleBox["i", "TI"]], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
      "D_i", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
     "TeXAssistantTemplate"], " "}], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a4788f8d-501d-4048-8878-297fa85ef4e7"],
 " is gaDirectional derivative (which preserves grades) and on the LHS is \
Multivector (vector) derivative.\n1)  ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{" ", "2"}]], 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
             StyleBox["A", "TI"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {},
      "input" -> "D^{\\,2}  A =D(D A)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "661d016b-863f-4389-9469-9154b0275e70"],
 ",\n2) ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[CenterDot]", 
             StyleBox["D", "TI"]}], ")"}], " ", 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["a", "TI"]], 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"], ","}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "(a \\cdot D) \\, A = D_{a} A,", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "4e8c89b2-cad9-4041-b92d-f08995aab513"],
 "\n3) ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SuperscriptBox[
            StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
            RowBox[{" ", "2"}]], ")"}], " ", 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["i", "TI"]], " ", 
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}], ")"}], " ", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
          SubscriptBox["\[Null]", 
           StyleBox["i", "TI"]]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
          SubscriptBox["\[Null]", 
           StyleBox["j", "TI"]]], 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"], ","}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> 
     "(D^{\\,2})\\,  A = (e^i \\, e^j) \\; D_{\\e_i}  D_{\\e_j}  A,", "state" -> 
     "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "3395c892-3a6e-4111-b682-3cfdd4f3ca5c"],
 "\n4) ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["D", "TI"], "\[CenterDot]", 
             StyleBox["D", "TI"]}], ")"}], " ", 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "\[CenterDot]", 
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}], ")"}], " ", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["i", "TI"]]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["j", "TI"]]], 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"], ","}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> 
     "(D \\cdot D) \\, A = (e^i \\cdot e^j) \\; D_{e_i}  D_{e_j}  A,", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "7b0793dc-6b66-443a-94c3-ae87366b2f0b"],
 "\n5) ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["D", "TI"], "\[Wedge]", 
             StyleBox["D", "TI"]}], ")"}], " ", 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "\[Wedge]", 
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}], ")"}], " ", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["i", "TI"]]], 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["j", "TI"]]], 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"], ","}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> 
     "(D \\wedge  D) \\, A = (e^i \\wedge e^j) \\; D_{e_i}  D_{e_j}  A,", 
     "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "2a658c9c-6216-4d9e-811d-229d993bee49"],
 "\n6) ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["D", "TI"], "\[Wedge]", 
             StyleBox["D", "TI"]}], ")"}], "\[CenterDot]", 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["i", "TI"]], "\[Wedge]", 
             SuperscriptBox[
              StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
              StyleBox["j", "TI"]]}], ")"}], "\[CenterDot]", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
              SubscriptBox[
               StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["i", "TI"]]], 
             SubscriptBox[
              StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
              SubscriptBox[
               StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
               StyleBox["j", "TI"]]], 
             StyleBox["A", "TI"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {},
      "input" -> 
     "(D \\wedge  D) \\cdot A = (e^i \\wedge e^j) \\cdot (D_{e_i}  D_{e_j}  \
A)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6348d88e-388b-42ea-99a4-cb06bc66954c"],
 "\n\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]Similar definitions for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["n", "TI"]], 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "D^n A", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "479b9de3-bced-4a5a-a590-e43d90f8fd9b"],
 "  and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SuperscriptBox[
            StyleBox["D", "TI"], 
            StyleBox["n", "TI"]], ")"}], 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "(D^n)A", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "25a8541d-d7a4-47ca-9109-9083e4fa0c53"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["D", "TI"], "\[Wedge]", "\[Ellipsis]", "\[Wedge]", 
             StyleBox["D", "TI"]}], ")"}], 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "(D \\wedge \\ldots \\wedge D) A", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "26cb20ab-fc4e-4755-9b50-763af84d9768"],
 ", as well as for expressions like ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["D", "TI"], "\[CenterDot]", 
             StyleBox["D", "TI"]}], ")"}], "\[Wedge]", 
         StyleBox["A", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "(D \\cdot D) \\wedge A", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "190abf82-07e8-4522-bc2f-b738f0f416ce"],
 " and its cousins, can be extrapolated straightforwardly from those above. \
Note the importance of explicit parenthesis in defining the notation.\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \nWhat is important is how we understand action of \
MultivectorDerivative on itself. In most cases (and applications) we see, \
that MultivectorDerivative DON\[CloseCurlyQuote]T ACT on itself (exception is \
exterior derivative ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["D", "TI"], "\[Wedge]", 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{
             StyleBox["D", "TI"], "\[Wedge]", 
             StyleBox["A", "TI"]}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {},
      "input" -> "D\\wedge (D \\wedge A)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "5c7d544b-dda4-42c8-b890-a6ac5e7fc697"],
 "."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"d8dd77c3-3dcc-4a72-90c1-aed4fc828b44"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{"(*", 
   RowBox[{
   "Setting", " ", "argument", " ", "as", " ", "noncommutative", " ", 
    "reduces", " ", "number", " ", "of", " ", "cases", " ", "in", " ", "the", 
    " ", 
    RowBox[{"gaMultivectorDerivativeExpand", "[", "]"}], " ", "expansion"}], 
   "  ", "*)"}], " ", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"HoldPattern", "[", 
      RowBox[{"gaCommutativeAllQ", "[", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"gaDerivativeArgument", "[", "_", "]"}], "[", "___", "]"}], 
       "]"}], "]"}], ":=", "False"}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"(*", " ", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"don", "'"}], "t", " ", "set", " ", "gaMultivectorDerivative", 
      " ", "noncommutative"}], ",", " ", 
     RowBox[{
     "since", " ", "we", " ", "want", " ", "it", " ", "to", " ", "float", " ",
       "when", " ", "basis", " ", "elements", " ", "are", " ", "absent"}]}], 
    " ", "*)"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
   RowBox[{"(*", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{
      RowBox[{"HoldPattern", "[", 
       RowBox[{"gaCommutativeAllQ", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"gaMultivectorDerivative", "[", "_", "]"}], "[", "__", "]"}],
         "]"}], "]"}], ":=", "False"}], ";"}], "*)"}]}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[1554]:=",ExpressionUUID->"260433e6-143f-4d34-86ad-e2a25ca0d4a6"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"gaVectorDerivative", "[", 
     RowBox[{"expr_", ",", 
      RowBox[{"coordName_String", ":", "gaRunningCoordinateChart"}]}], "]"}], 
    ":=", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"With", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"primaryVector", "=", 
          RowBox[{"gaPrimaryVectors", "[", "coordName", "]"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"reciprocalVector", "=", 
          RowBox[{"gaReciprocalVectors", "[", "coordName", "]"}]}], ",", 
         RowBox[{"theId", "=", 
          RowBox[{"ToString", "[", 
           RowBox[{"Unique", "[", "\"\<D\>\"", "]"}], "]"}]}]}], "}"}], ",", 
       "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
       RowBox[{"GeometricProduct", "[", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"gaMultivectorDerivative", "[", "theId", "]"}], "[", 
          RowBox[{"reciprocalVector", ",", "primaryVector"}], "]"}], ",", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"gaDerivativeArgument", "[", "theId", "]"}], "[", "expr", 
          "]"}]}], "]"}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}], "/;", 
     RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"{", 
        RowBox[{
         RowBox[{"gaPrimaryVectors", "[", "gaRunningCoordinateChart", "]"}], 
         ",", 
         RowBox[{
         "gaReciprocalVectors", "[", "gaRunningCoordinateChart", "]"}]}], 
        "}"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"(", 
         RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"Head", "[", "#", "]"}], "===", "List"}], ")"}], "&"}]}], 
      "]"}]}]}], ";"}], "\n"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{"gaVectorDerivative", "[", 
    RowBox[{"expr_", ",", "reciprocalVector_List", ",", 
     RowBox[{"primaryVector_List", ":", 
      RowBox[{"gaPrimaryVectors", "[", "gaRunningCoordinateChart", "]"}]}]}], 
    "]"}], ":=", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"gaMultivectorDerivative", "[", 
     RowBox[{"expr", ",", "reciprocalVector", ",", "primaryVector"}], "]"}], "/;", 
    RowBox[{
     RowBox[{"AllTrue", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"Cases", "[", 
        RowBox[{"reciprocalVector", ",", "_mvDownUp", ",", "Infinity", ",", 
         RowBox[{"Heads", "->", "True"}]}], "]"}], ",", 
       RowBox[{
        RowBox[{"MatchQ", "[", 
         RowBox[{"#", ",", 
          RowBox[{"mvDownUp", "[", 
           RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"{", "}"}], ",", 
            RowBox[{"{", "_", "}"}]}], "]"}]}], "]"}], "&"}]}], "]"}], "&&", 
     RowBox[{"Head", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"gaPrimaryVectors", "[", "gaRunningCoordinateChart", "]"}], "===",
        "List"}], "]"}]}]}]}], ";"}]}], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[1555]:=",ExpressionUUID->"62c6626d-86f7-4a90-ba49-77ec0eb99d55"],

Cell[BoxData[{
 RowBox[{
  RowBox[{
   RowBox[{
